cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the results of this model in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Model MEML 75: Quark and lepton mass matrices from mixed T2/Z3 x T2/Z4 geometry with axion-like dark matter and leptogenesis"
abstract: "We present model MEML 75, which parametrizes the fermion sector of the Standard Model through the geometry of mixed six-dimensional orbifolds. The model has 11 effective fitted parameters (10 Lagrangian parameters plus the ALP misalignment angle) fitting 16 observables, yielding N_dof^fit = +5. Main testable consequences include axion-like dark matter at f_a = 1.9801e11 GeV (m_a = 28.407 ueV), and three conditional predictions: sum(m_i) = 0.068 eV, m_betabeta = 8.37 meV, and delta_CP = 23 degrees or 157 degrees."
